+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 A v-if="false" element in a nested component's slot renders no comment in the SSR output of a dynamic component slot (packages/server-renderer/__tests__/ssrSlot.spec.ts) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 A v-if="true" element in the same nested slot still renders its content (packages/server-renderer/__tests__/ssrSlot.spec.ts) [AC-2]
+- [ ] 1.3 A template v-if="false" passed straight to the dynamic component slot renders an empty slot fragment (packages/server-renderer/__tests__/ssrSlot.spec.ts) [AC-1]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Export the runtime's slot content check through ssrUtils (packages/runtime-core/src/helpers/renderSlot.ts, packages/runtime-core/src/index.ts)
+- [ ] 2.2 Check vnode slot content in ssrRenderSlotInner and render the fallback when it holds nothing valid (packages/server-renderer/src/helpers/ssrRenderSlot.ts)
